bluejetty:00026415:ios.description:
Check the neighborhood before purchasing or renting you next home!
The App provide the following information:
- Population & distribution at different granularities: from county -> zipcode -> census tract -> census block (also nearby block aggregation); Including race, birth countries, households income, families, children, education levels, and much more information!
- Latest Crime data for the last 6 months (updated frequently!), including all details (e.g. date time, address, description, case number, local police department source, etc);
- Detailed School information including school attendance boundary, school test score summaries, school test scores by various student groups and dimensions (e.g. low-income, disabilities, different races, different parents education levels)
- Noise level from aviation/airport, railways, roads, highways;
- Superfund & National Priority List information, include details;
- Homeless Shelters include details;
- Electric Transmission Lines with detailed voltage information;
- Odor smell map (Only for Milpitas, BayArea, CA);
- Search any address or place on the map, and find the nearby information around that location.
You can also open this app and automatically search a shared address from other apps (e.g. RedFin, Zillow).
Our App currently covers data mostly for BayArea, California, but we are working VERY HARD to expand coverage to the entire United States. 
Your questions and suggestions are always welcome, as your satisfaction is our top priority. 
Our goal is to create a perfect product that meets all your needs.
Note: All information & data are available for free-trial and the following detailed data requires paid subscription:
- Detailed level population & demographic data;
- Detailed School information;
- Detailed information & links of Superfund sites and Homeless shelters;
- Electric transmission lines;
While we'd love to make everything free, the reality of server and data costs means we need to reserve certain features for our premium subscribers. By choosing the premium subscription, you'll unlock full access to all our data. Your support is invaluable – it enables us to continuously enhance our App & Services, ensuring you get the best experience possible!
Link to standard Apple Terms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/

